cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated paper."
title: "MRI radiomics does not predict receptor status in breast-cancer brain metastases: analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Leakage-controlled nested cross-validation pipeline evaluating whether MRI radiomic features
  predict oestrogen receptor, progesterone receptor and HER2 status in breast-cancer brain
  metastases, together with permutation-null, power, preprocessing-sensitivity, optimism-benchmark
  and external feature-transfer analyses. The study reports a negative result.
